runmat 0.7
std 1

// The intelligent flight battery: a 6S 2,000 mAh LiPo pack (22.2 V, the flight controller's and
// ESC's supply) in a moulded case that drops into the bay over the props' thrust centre
// (x = -62 to -3.5 mm), so the drone hovers level on equal thrust.
// Its case is the body's own loft clipped to the bay less a 0.5 mm clearance, so its lid
// carries the shell's curvature from x = -62 mm to -28.5 mm and closes the top flush; its front
// third slides under the upper shell. Its origin is the body origin, so it places at identity.
// For mass it is one lumped body: cells, case and electronics at 2,110 kg/m^3 over the case's
// 141 cm^3, 297 g (a 6S 2,000 mAh pack's weight).
